    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575">

                <pb facs="0603" n="597" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg597"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to state, in
                    confirmation of my telegram to you of the 3d instant, that the Department has
                    signified to the chargé d’affaires <hi rendition="#italic">ad interim</hi> of
                    Germany its cordial concurrence in the appointment of Mr. Schmidt, late
                    vice-consul of Germany at Apia, as president of the municipal council in
                    Samoa.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
